<LegalPage title="Cookie Policy | Local Search Pro" heading="Cookie Policy" description="How the Local Search Pro website uses cookies and similar technologies.">
  <p>This policy explains how <strong>www.localsearchpro.co.uk</strong> uses cookies and similar technologies. Read it together with our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
  <p>Cookies are small text files that a website stores on your device when you visit. They are widely used to make websites work, to remember your choices and to understand how a site is used.</p>

  <h2>How we use cookies</h2>
  <p>At the time of writing, this website <strong>does not set any cookies</strong> on your device, and it does not use analytics, advertising or tracking tools. Our fonts and images are served from our own website rather than from third parties.</p>
  <p>Because we do not use cookies that need your consent, we do not show a cookie banner.</p>

  <h2>If this changes</h2>
  <p>If we add tools that use cookies or similar technologies (for example website analytics), we will ask for your consent first where the law requires it, give you a way to change your mind, and update this policy.</p>

  <h2>Third-party content and links</h2>
  <p>If you follow a link from our website to another website, that site may use its own cookies. We do not control them, so please check that site's cookie policy.</p>

  <h2>Managing cookies in your browser</h2>
  <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. How you do this depends on the browser, and the help pages for your browser explain the steps. Blocking some cookies on other websites may affect how they work.</p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about this policy, please use our <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
